# Chess Openings — example PHP-only crontab apply phase (NOT installed or active).
# Only use AFTER the Symfony app, app:openings:apply-bundle command, staging
# directory and a trusted TypeScript/CI job that prepares validated bundles exist.
# This is the alternative host-cron apply scheduler. For normal operation prefer
# the GitHub Actions weekly cron described in docs/OPENING_UPDATES.md; do not
# enable two competing schedules that both promote catalogue revisions.
#
# Runs every Monday at 05:17 in the HOST cron timezone (verify the host TZ).
# Change PHP executable, account home path, private staging directory, and logs.
# A no-change bundle must be a successful no-op.
#
17 5 * * 1 /usr/local/bin/php /home/ACCOUNT/chess-openings/backend/bin/console app:openings:apply-bundle --bundle=/home/ACCOUNT/private/chess-openings/imports/latest --env=prod --no-interaction >> /home/ACCOUNT/logs/chess-opening-sync.log 2>&1
